{"about_the_game":"Make your way through the many race cars, wepons and tracks to claim victory among the greatest veg out crew racers there is. A top down racer with it's own blend of personality and style. Choose your racer, choose your weapon, buckle up and prepare to race through the Veg out World.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boosters</h2>All racing games are that much more fun with boosters!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/4a35ad1aabd4d550998127e56a08a72d.poster.avif?t=1729620519\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/4a35ad1aabd4d550998127e56a08a72d.webm?t=1729620519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/4a35ad1aabd4d550998127e56a08a72d.mp4?t=1729620519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Teleports</h2>Don't miss those teleports, take advantage while boosting for even far greater advantage!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/858a41ee2635b4bd025160a28abf8e01.poster.avif?t=1729620519\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/858a41ee2635b4bd025160a28abf8e01.webm?t=1729620519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/858a41ee2635b4bd025160a28abf8e01.mp4?t=1729620519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mines and other dangers</h2>Watch out for those mines! There's a lot of different weaponry and objects out there to hurt you too!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/ab6fac28b2570a57378751a540ef6639.poster.avif?t=1729620519\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/ab6fac28b2570a57378751a540ef6639.webm?t=1729620519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/ab6fac28b2570a57378751a540ef6639.mp4?t=1729620519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turrets and bullets</h2>Don't forget to dodge those turrets, bullets, mines, you name it. Watch every turn and action in case it's a fatal one!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/5013c404baa6b931eb64469f4bfd3693.poster.avif?t=1729620519\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/5013c404baa6b931eb64469f4bfd3693.webm?t=1729620519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/5013c404baa6b931eb64469f4bfd3693.mp4?t=1729620519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Teleports gone wrong</h2>Running behind a little? Make sure to take advantage of those teleports, shortcuts and what ever else can increase your changes of winning, but be precise about it or it ay backfire!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/252e2b578e1becf45aa992136ca9880b.poster.avif?t=1729620519\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/252e2b578e1becf45aa992136ca9880b.webm?t=1729620519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/252e2b578e1becf45aa992136ca9880b.mp4?t=1729620519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Watch those bullets<br>As mentioned earlier, there are lots of dangers. The amount of flying bullets, obstacles and other dangerous things is right infront of you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/2648839e4c8dece8e1c631d3f34ad6c4.poster.avif?t=1729620519\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/2648839e4c8dece8e1c631d3f34ad6c4.webm?t=1729620519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/extras/2648839e4c8dece8e1c631d3f34ad6c4.mp4?t=1729620519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Get out there and start those veg out engines!<br><br>Happy veg out crew!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2874380?t=1729620519","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1729620519","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1729620519","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874380/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1729620519","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Make your way through the many race cars, wepons and tracks to claim victory among the greatest veg out crew racers there is. A top down racer with it's own blend of personality and style. Choose your racer, choose your weapon, buckle up and